  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut carrot, potato and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Set air fryer to 200°C. Place veggies into the air fryer basket, season with salt, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Cook for 10 minutes. Shake the basket, then cook until tender, a further 5-10 minutes. TIP: No air fryer? Prep carrot, potato, zucchini as above. Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray with a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43dd42dc4b928199fc56/step-c4c70100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice silverbeet.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43dd42dc4b928199fc56/step-96aa3910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes cook time remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tomato paste, garlic & herb seasoning and garlic, stirring until fragrant, 30 seconds. Add the water, salt and the brown sugar, then bring to a simmer and cook until reduced, 2-4 minutes.\n• Add roasted veggies, snacking tomatoes and silverbeet and cook until wilted, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43dd42dc4b928199fc56/step-10625120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mediterranean veggie soup between bowls.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes. Top with flaked almonds, haloumi and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683d43dd42dc4b928199fc56/step-b795e830.jpg"
    }
  ]
